# .semgrepignore - Files and patterns to ignore for semgrep scanning
# Generated based on MARK Protocol codebase analysis

# Build artifacts and generated files
**/contracts/out/**
**/contracts/cache/**
**/contracts/broadcast/**
**/contracts/lib/**
**/circuits/build/**
**/circuits/node_modules/**

# Test files - these have patterns that trigger false positives
**/contracts/test/**/*.sol
**/contracts/test/**/*.t.sol
**/circuits/test/**/*.ts
**/circuits/test/**/*.mjs

# Generated/crypto files with constants that look like secrets
**/contracts/src/crypto/generated/**
**/circuits/crypto/generated/**

# Test and script directories
**/test/**/*
**/script/**/*
**/scripts/**/*

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/**

# Build output
**/build/**/*
**/out/**/*

# Configuration files that may contain patterns that look like secrets
**/*.toml
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml

# Documentation
**/docs/**/*
**/*.md

# IDE and editor configs
.vscode/**
.idea/**
.cursor/**
*.swp
*.swo

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE config
.vs/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# Environment and secret files (these are template/examples, not actual secrets)
.env.example
.env.local
.env.*.example